sed to predict the MN titer for seasonal influenza A (H1N1) viruses\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"For calculation of geometric mean titer (GMT) estimates, a titer of <10 was assigned a value of 5\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"In the statistical models, study participants were treated as random effects\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\", \"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}